msgctxt "244"
msgid "Phew... hah... (How can somebody that fat be so fast...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "(Damn. I guess I should head back to Gelateria Kamurocho...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Urgh, he pisses me off! What kind of asshole runs out on his bill!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"Well, if he's so hungry... next time I see him, I'm gonna feed him a "
"knuckle sandwich!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Urgh... hah... Dammit..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"This time, it was like you were trying to get me to chase you. What were "
"you thinking?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Nobody's ever chased after me like you do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "There aren't enough dine and dash pros like me left in this world..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Dine and dash pros?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid ""
"I mean it's hard to run on a full stomach, and even if you get away, you "
"end up hungry again from all the exercise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "It's hard being a dine and dash pro. You know what it's like, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Just hurry up and pay. I'm taking you right back to Gelateria Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "I... I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "The cost of your gelato comes to... 7,000 yen. So let's see the cash! Now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid ""
"If you've got the cash, then just pay the damn bill in the first place! "
"What, are you just doing this for kicks?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "I... I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "Don't ever show your face here again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid ""
"And you! You've earned this. Seriously, I'm grateful, even if I'm still "
"pissed off..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Staminan Spark<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid ""
"I'm done. No more dining and dashing for me. If today proved anything, it's "
"that I'll never escape you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "Good. Glad to hear it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid ""
"I think it's time I left on a journey for myself. Have a good life... I "
"don't think we'll ever meet again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "(Is this it? Is Kamurocho's era of dining and dashing finally over?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid ""
"Then just quit dining and dashing. Think about how it affects the shops you "
"raid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid ""
"You're right. I'm done. No more dining and dashing for me. After all... "
"I'll never be able to escape you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "Good. Glad to hear it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid ""
"I think it's time I left on a journey for myself.\r\n"
"Have a good life... I don't think we'll ever meet again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid "If you're leaving, make sure you pay what you owe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid "Oh... I almost forgot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid "The cost of your gelato comes to... 7,000 yen. So let's see the cash! Now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid ""
"If you've got the cash, then just pay the damn bill in the first place! "
"What, are you just doing this for kicks?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid "I... I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid "Don't ever show your face here again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1048"
msgid ""
"And you! You've earned this. Seriously, I'm grateful, even if I'm still "
"pissed off..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1060"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Staminan Spark<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1096"
msgid ""
"What's going on? Why do I feel so weird? Is it indigestion? But... I can't "
"stop thinking about that shop manager! What is this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1120"
msgid "(Is this it? Is Kamurocho's era of dining and dashing finally over?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1144"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1204"
msgid "What!? That dine-and-dasher again!? What's with that guy!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1216"
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1228"
msgid "Oh, it's you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1240"
msgid "Look, over there. That damn dine-and-dasher's back again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1252"
msgid ""
"What kind of smug asshole thinks he can get away with dining and dashing "
"from the same place twice!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1264"
msgid ""
"Dammit, I'm too mad to think straight! Could you catch him for me? I just "
"want to know why he's doing this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1276"
msgid "I can't, but I'll watch the shop for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1288"
msgid ""
"Uh-huh. Hilarious. I'll assume that was supposed to be a joke, and you're "
"not looking to get slapped yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1312"
msgid "Argh, are you kidding me!? He got away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1324"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1336"
msgid "Petty goddamn thief... Next time I see him, I'll cave his face in!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1348"
msgid "Fine. I just need to catch him, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1360"
msgid "You'll do it? Great! You're a standup guy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1372"
msgid ""
"Well, then, when you catch him, haul him back here, would you? I'll give "
"him what he deserves!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1396"
msgid ""
"You gotta be kidding me! What kind of asshole runs out on his bill? In this "
"day and age!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1408"
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1420"
msgid ""
"Urgh, just another dine-and-dasher! This guy eats every flavor of gelato we "
"have, and then he's out the door!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1432"
msgid "Oh, there he is!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1444"
msgid "I wonder why he's waiting there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1456"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1468"
msgid "Wish I could leave the shop and go after him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1480"
msgid "Hey, could you chase him down for me? I just want to slap that creep!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1492"
msgid "I can't, but I'll watch the shop for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1504"
msgid "Uh-huh. Hilarious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1516"
msgid ""
"I'll assume that was supposed to be a joke, and you're not looking to get "
"slapped yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1540"
msgid "Argh, are you kidding me!? He got away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1552"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1564"
msgid "Petty goddamn thief... Next time I see him, I'll cave his face in!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1576"
msgid "All right. I just need to catch him, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1588"
msgid "You'll do it? Great! You're a standup guy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1600"
msgid ""
"Well, when you catch him, bring him here. I'll give him the punishment he "
"deserves!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1624"
msgid "Just hurry up and pay."
msgstr ""

